Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:44.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（捷克 布拉格）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,M并不会介意你额外赚点小钱 赖安\N{\fnArial\fs30}M doesn't mind you earning a little money on the side, Dryden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是希望 不要靠出卖机密来赚钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd just prefer it if it wasn't selling secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是想吓吓我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the theatrics are supposed to scare me…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…邦德 你找错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you have the wrong man, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果M真的认为我变节了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If M was so sure that I was bent…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…她会派00探员来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she'd have sent a double-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管只是区域主管…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benefits of being section chief…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我知道所有被晋升为00身份的探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'd know if anyone had been promoted to double-0 status…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的档案显示你没杀过人 而且… - 杀过2个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your file shows no kills, and it takes… - Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间还了解甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely got to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你把枪放在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where you keep your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我还是了解你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的联络人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫你感受到了死亡 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made you feel it, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second is…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considerably.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:03:59.44,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之大战皇家赌场》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:12.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（乌干达 姆巴莱）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么才能放心把钱交给这个 素未谋面的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do I trust this man that I've never met with my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求引见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for the introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的组织只能向你担保这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all my organization will guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.55,0:08:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们的朋友 怀特先生已经告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose our friend Mr. White will have told you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这些年来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I have provided reliable banking services…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我向很多自由战士 提供了可靠的银行服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for many other freedom fighters over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.43,0:08:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信上帝吗 拉西福先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in God, Mr. Le Chiffre?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信合理的回报率\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in a reasonable rate of return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想投资有任何风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want no risk in the portfolio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在全球任何一个角落提钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can access it anywhere in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱到手了 做空一百万…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the money, so short another million shares…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…股天空舰的股票\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of Skyfleet stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 要知道你这可 是在和市场对赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you must know you're betting against the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都一致认为这支股只涨不跌\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one expects this stock to go anywhere but up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,照做就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:41.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马达加斯加）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:10:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们的朋友 在自己脸上烧了不少伤疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like our man. Burn scars on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道炸弹制造者 能不能给这种事投保\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if bomb-makers are insured for things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.47,0:10:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始行动了 他正径直向我走来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the move, and he's heading straight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别摸你的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop touching your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 把手放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry? - Put your hand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把该死的枪放下 卡特 我要抓活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holster the bloody weapon, Carter. I need him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,流血泪只不过是泪腺重排的缘故…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weeping blood comes merely from a derangement of the tear duct…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.56,0:20:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…亲爱的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my dear general.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟邪恶可不着边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing sinister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有2对 你有17.4%的机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have two pair, and you have a 17.4 percent chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of making your straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:58.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国政府探员杀害手无寸铁的囚犯）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「省略号」什么时候失效？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When does Ellipsis expire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有不到36小时 我可以… - 不 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have less than 36 hours. I can… - No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有这么多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all the time I have anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫客人5分钟内离开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give our guests five minutes to leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…否则把他们丢到船外\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or throw them overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们究竟觉得自己是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell do they think they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向首相汇报 他很聪明…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I report to the prime minister, even he's smart enough…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但他都不具体追究我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not to ask me what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我总是遇到一些自以为是的饭桶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen such a bunch of self-righteous, arse-covering prigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不关心我们在做什么 他们只在乎被拍照的人在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't care what we do, they care what we get photographed doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德怎么会这么愚蠢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how the hell could Bond be so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了他00身份 他却拿枪击使馆作为庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give him double-0 status, he celebrates by shooting an embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了吗？他现在到底在什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the man deranged? And where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要在过去 探员做出这么难堪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the old days, if an agent did something embarrassing…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定得要叛逃才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he'd have the good sense to defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我真是怀念冷战时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, I miss the Cold War.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.34,0:22:11.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已发送短消息）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:13.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴哈马）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:36.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（海洋俱乐部）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是厚颜无耻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a bloody cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.17,0:23:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,下回我一定先打掉摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shoot the camera first next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.11,0:23:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你袭击了一个使馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stormed into an embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.24,0:23:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你侵犯了唯一神圣不可侵犯的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You violated the only absolutely inviolate rule…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…国际关系准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of international relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.78,0:23:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢？为了杀一个无名之辈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why? So you could kill a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是要审问他 而不是杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to question him, not kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:28.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（情报员击毙无武装囚犯）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.12,0:23:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你应该运用一下你的判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake. You're supposed to display some kind of judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.96,0:23:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为世上少一个 炸弹制造者是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought one less bomb-maker in the world would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一个制造炸弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. One bomb-maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在试图找出 恐怖组织网的资金来源…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to find out how an entire network of terrorist groups is financed…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.73,0:23:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你却给我个造炸弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you give us one bomb-maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难算全盘情况 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly the big picture, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.77,0:23:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人都不是真正的信徒 他只是个雇佣杀手而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man isn't even a true believer. He's a gun for hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.21,0:23:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了你那过度发达的扣扳机的手指…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks to your trigger finger…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.24,0:23:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…现在我们根本无法得知谁雇佣了他 目的为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we have no idea who hired him or why.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:23:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟是怎么找到我住的地方的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how the hell did you find out where I lived?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:23:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我发现你真实姓名的方法一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same way I found out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.65,0:24:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为M只是随机取的一个字母 没想到它代表的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought "M" was randomly assigned. I had no idea it stood for…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.79,0:24:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是再说一个字 我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utter one more syllable and I'll have you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道不应该这么快就提升你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was too early to promote you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.00,0:24:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道00身份的探员寿命都不长…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I understand double-0s have a very short life-expectancy…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.13,0:24:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…所以你犯的错误也是短暂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so your mistake will be short-lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.57,0:24:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 对于一个愚钝的人来说 这些可能难以理解…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond, this may be too much for a blunt instrument to understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.68,0:24:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但是盲目自大和自我意识 几乎不可能协调共存\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but arrogance and self-awareness seldom go hand in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.68,0:24:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你希望我是半个圣人 半个终极杀手了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want me to be half monk, half hit-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.59,0:24:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何刺客都可以杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any thug can kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.66,0:24:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能克服你的自负…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to take your ego out of the equation…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…冷静的分析局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and to judge the situation dispassionately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.73,0:24:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要确定我可以信任你 而你也清楚信任谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to know I can trust you, and that you know who to trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.07,0:24:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在还不能确定 我要你在我眼前消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since I don't know that, I need you out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.80,0:24:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个地方冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and stick your head in the sand somewhere…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…好好考虑一下你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and think about your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.61,0:24:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些混蛋现在想要你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because these bastards want your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.71,0:25:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正严肃考虑 是否把你交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm seriously considering feeding you to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.52,0:25:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 邦德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bond…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.93,0:25:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不要再擅闯我家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't ever break into my house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.65,0:25:41.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴哈马 拿骚）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.20,0:26:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 先生 欢迎光临海洋俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, sir, and welcome to the Ocean Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.19,0:26:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是帮我停车还是让我这么等着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to take this or make me wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 先生 对不起 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, sir. Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.24,0:27:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安去停车场 保安去停车场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security to car park. Security to car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.18,0:29:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临海洋俱乐部 先生 您要入住吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Ocean Club, sir. Checking in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.88,0:29:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但我这是一时冲动之举 我并没有提前预定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But it's a spur-of-the-moment thing, and I haven't got a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.42,0:29:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有间面向大海的豪华房 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have an ocean-view villa. - Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我个忙吗？我昨晚在这里进晚餐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you do me a favor? I was here last night…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.37,0:29:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我把车停在一辆非常漂亮的 1964年出厂的阿斯顿马丁旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I parked my car next to a very beautiful 1964 Aston Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.57,0:29:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它的车门刮了 你是否知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I nicked the door. You wouldn't happen to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.84,0:29:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是迪米特雷斯先生的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Dimitrios. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.91,0:29:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他本人还没有发现 我觉得这事最好还是不要提\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he hasn't noticed, I'm not sure I'd mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.41,0:30:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对坏消息的反应可很强烈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't the type to take bad news well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.05,0:30:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我要找他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I felt compelled to find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.08,0:30:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在海边有栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a house just up the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.86,0:30:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.25,0:31:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 他现在在巴拿马\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - He's in the Bahamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.15,0:31:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我吵醒就是为了告诉我 他在哪里度假？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You woke me to share his holiday plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.79,0:31:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他使用你的名字和密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's logged into our secure website…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.06,0:31:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,登陆到我们的加密网\N{\fnArial\fs30}…using your name and password.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.23,0:31:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how the hell does he know these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.30,0:31:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力找出答案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm doing my best to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.87,0:31:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他现在在查谁？- 阿里克斯·迪米特雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's he looking at? - Alex Dimitrios.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.17,0:31:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That slimy bugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.35,0:31:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在查的是他的同伙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now known associates…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.42,0:32:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要些什么吗 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I assist you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.35,0:32:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 一大杯奇峰朗姆酒加苏打 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. Large Mount Gay with soda, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.46,0:32:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧 都是些什么事情啊 - 老兄 手气不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look what just happened. - Good job, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.63,0:32:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.73,0:32:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我也玩两把吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I join?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.90,0:32:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 - 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, good evening. How are you? - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.78,0:32:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小盲注 大盲注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small blind, big blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.99,0:32:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet's to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.36,0:33:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是来祝我好运的话 你迟到了2小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that was for luck, you're two hours late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.73,0:33:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,2万跟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hundred to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.84,0:33:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet's to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.31,0:33:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.44,0:33:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,5千跟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.81,0:33:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 轮到你了 - 一对7\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Action's to you. - Pair of sevens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.31,0:33:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace high.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.35,0:33:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟牌还是让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check or bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.02,0:33:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟牌 - 轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - And to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.72,0:33:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进5千\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.73,0:33:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进5千\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.91,0:33:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟牌 - 到你了 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - Check to you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部都押上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.95,0:33:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.15,0:33:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,两万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.95,0:34:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只限台上的注 对不起 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Table stakes. I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.92,0:34:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这个在台上 我的车 可以赌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. This is on the table. That's my car. Wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.63,0:34:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 迪米特雷斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mr. Dimitrios.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.70,0:34:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 给他个机会把钱赢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no. Give him a chance to win his money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.91,0:34:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请亮牌 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, show me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.65,0:34:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,3张K\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.26,0:34:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go with my night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.23,0:34:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,3张A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trip aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.83,0:34:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,A赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aces win.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.67,0:34:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 停车票也给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the valet ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.31,0:34:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.94,0:34:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.57,0:35:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.94,0:35:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪他情绪那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder he was in such a foul mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.35,0:35:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.75,0:35:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能送你回家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I give you a lift home?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.69,0:35:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他一定会气疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would really send him over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.26,0:35:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我还没有那么残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'm not that cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.52,0:35:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你都生疏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, perhaps you're just out of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.27,0:35:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.77,0:35:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我那喝一杯怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about a drink at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.51,0:36:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.84,0:36:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离这里近吗？- 非常近\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it close? - Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.08,0:36:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}One drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.38,0:36:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 先生 欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, sir, and welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.08,0:36:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到我的住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.23,0:36:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白为什么这是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a hard time seeing how this is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.50,0:37:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的计划 我只负责给你找人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your plan. All I did was get you the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.37,0:37:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人正在被英国情报局监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who was under surveillance by the British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我开始怀疑是否该信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes me wonder if I can trust you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.44,0:37:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别信任我 我根本不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then don't. I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.11,0:37:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我在乎我的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do care about my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我另外给你找能干这活的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have someone else willing to do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.52,0:37:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只需要知道一些细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just needs the particulars…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.12,0:37:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.90,0:37:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢已婚女人 是不是 詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like married women, don't you, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.70,0:37:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样事情简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps things simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.84,0:37:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的人才是坏人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it about bad men?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是我丈夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, my husband…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.01,0:37:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有那么多获得幸福的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had so many chances to be happy…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.88,0:37:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,…很多不错的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so many nice guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.45,0:37:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那些男人不能象你一样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't nice guys be more like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.36,0:37:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为要是那样的话 他们就是坏人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because then they'd be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.53,0:38:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是却会有意思的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But so much more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.80,0:38:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你丈夫是坏人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes your husband a bad man?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.44,0:38:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大概是他的本性吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nature, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.21,0:38:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的工作性质吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nature of his work?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.14,0:38:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕那是个迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mystery, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.42,0:38:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也怕你和我睡觉 就是为了了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also afraid you will sleep with me in order to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.92,0:38:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.96,0:38:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在没有退路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.33,0:38:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能问你个私人问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a personal question?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.17,0:38:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可是好时机啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now would seem an appropriate time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.04,0:38:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「省略号」对你来说有什么意义吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does "ellipsis" mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.85,0:39:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是该问问他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I ask him about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.23,0:39:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐今晚最后一班飞机去迈阿密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on the last flight tonight to Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.70,0:39:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用等我了 我明早回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait up. I'll be back in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.53,0:39:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.07,0:39:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.37,0:39:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 他现在正在 飞往迈阿密的最后一趟航班上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently he's on the last flight to Miami…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.98,0:39:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你有整晚的时间审问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so you have all night to question me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.98,0:39:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.65,0:39:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要多来点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we're gonna need…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.99,0:39:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…some more champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.26,0:39:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 客房服务部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. Room Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.90,0:39:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 我想要一瓶冰香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. Can I get a bottle of chilled Bollinger Grand Annee…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.90,0:39:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鱼子酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the beluga caviar?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.40,0:39:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他配料 酒具之类的也都要吗？- 是的 都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With everything? - Yes, with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.97,0:39:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两份吗 先生？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And would that be for two, sir? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.27,0:39:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要两份吗？- 不 只要一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For two? - No, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.71,0:40:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.45,0:40:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 53牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Number 53.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.59,0:40:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,冯·哈根斯博士的人体世界 欢迎您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. von Hagens' Body Worlds invites visitors…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.16,0:40:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来参观人体的运动系统、消化系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to observe the body's various locomotive, digestive…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.20,0:40:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经系统和动脉系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nervous and vascular systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.56,0:41:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 女士们 请大家注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please may I have your attention, ladies and gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.60,0:42:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在看到的 是很特别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it is something very special, what we see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.07,0:42:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是寓教于乐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is edutainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.85,0:42:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…栩栩如生的造型…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fixed in dramatic and athletic poses…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.25,0:42:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼真地再现了人体器官的立体结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}… that reveal the true-to-life spatial relationships amongst organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.40,0:42:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.20,0:42:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的车停在明显的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not leave your vehicle unattended.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.41,0:43:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到迈阿密国际机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Miami International Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.18,0:43:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,机场前的路边不允许停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curbside parking in front of the terminal is restricted…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.81,0:44:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 我是邦德 我要找M\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - It's Bond. I need her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.01,0:44:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在不能被打扰 可以给她带个口信吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid she can't be disturbed. Can I take a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.95,0:44:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 你快点找到她 告诉她打电话给迈阿密机场安全部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you go and find her, tell her to call Security at Miami Airport…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.42,0:44:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我认为这里会有炸弹爆炸 你现在就去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because I think a bomb is about to go off. Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.46,0:45:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 请稍等 - 我想你可以办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, can I put you on hold? - I thought you might.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.56,0:45:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德？你现在究竟是要干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond? What the hell are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.14,0:45:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会给你打过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.93,0:45:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天空舰570原型机 - 它怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Skyfleet S570 prototype. - What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.46,0:45:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最大的飞机 今天将于迈阿密机场公诸于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The largest airplane in the world will be unveiled today at Miami Airport."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.11,0:46:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.38,0:46:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德？邦德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond? Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.95,0:46:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标是天空舰570型\N{\fnArial\fs30}His target is the Skyfleet prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.25,0:46:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将于今天试飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's launching today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.22,0:46:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.72,0:51:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车！停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.22,0:52:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！快走！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get moving! Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.21,0:53:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,空头失效了 很抱歉 我不清楚你究竟损失了多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}The puts expired. I'm sorry, I'm not sure yet how much you've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.19,0:53:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一亿零一百二十万六千美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred and one million, two hundred and six thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.13,0:54:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人告密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.12,0:54:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到了你想找的了？- 是的 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got everything you need? - Yeah, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.23,0:54:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要照些相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get a few more photos…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.68,0:54:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么尸体会浮肿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the body count you're stacking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.51,0:54:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是先被折磨过 你已经杀了她丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was tortured first. As you'd already killed her husband…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.45,0:54:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们现在没人审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she must have been the only one left to question.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.79,0:54:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道你的底细吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she know anything that could compromise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.09,0:54:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.26,0:55:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的真实姓名和意图呢？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not your name, what you were after? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.93,0:55:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪米特雷斯是个中间商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dimitrios worked as a middleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.56,0:55:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,总能获取武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew where to put his hands on weapons…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.53,0:55:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也能找到买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and people who could use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.16,0:55:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有钱就给谁干\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked with anyone who had money.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.00,0:55:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来和一个叫拉西福的人 关系甚为密切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years he was involved with a man we knew as Le Chiffre…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.57,0:55:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人是世界各地恐怖组织背后的银行家\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a private banker to the world's terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.67,0:55:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为恐怖分子投资洗钱 他们可以随意提取\N{\fnArial\fs30}He invested their money, gave them access to it wherever they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.34,0:55:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.31,0:55:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人是阿尔巴尼亚人 国际象棋高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albanian, we believe. Chess prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.08,0:55:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,数学天才 喜欢用打牌来证明这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit of a mathematical genius and liked to prove it by playing poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.91,0:55:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想监视我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can keep an eye on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.75,0:56:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.16,0:56:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,专家在911之后分析股市时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they analyzed the stock market after 9/11…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.56,0:56:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国中情局发现有人 大做航空公司股票的空头\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the ClA discovered a massive shorting of airline stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.73,0:56:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,9月12日当股市跌到谷底时有人发了笔大财\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the stocks hit bottom on 9/12, somebody made a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.53,0:56:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早同样的事本应该发生在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing happened this morning with Skyfleet stock…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.43,0:56:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…天空舰的股票上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.84,0:56:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果原型机被摧毁 公司将会破产\N{\fnArial\fs30}With their prototype destroyed, the company would be near bankruptcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.71,0:56:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 有人却因押错而损失过亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, somebody lost over $100 million betting the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.75,0:56:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是这个叫拉西福的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's this man Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.85,0:56:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也解释了他为什么要在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which would explain how he could set up a high-stakes poker game…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.15,0:56:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑山的皇家赌场开高额赌局\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at Casino Royale in Montenegro.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.89,0:56:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,10位玩家 每人赌注1千万 可以再买注5百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten players, $10 million buy-in, 5 million re-buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.16,0:56:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢家全拿 赌金可能高达1亿5千万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner takes all. Potentially 150 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.13,0:56:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 这样我们就找到他的行踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then we'll know where he'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要利索地宰了他呢 还只是给他个警告？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a clean kill or to send a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.07,0:56:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要他活着 拉西福没有一亿美元去输\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want him alive. Le Chiffre doesn't have 100 million to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.54,0:56:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他是在用客户的钱玩股票吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he been playing the stock market with his clients' funds?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.14,0:56:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,客户知道钱没了 一定会大怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna be too happy when they find out it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.18,0:57:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他赢这场赌局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let him win this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.75,0:57:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果输了 他就没处可逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he loses, he'll have nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.18,0:57:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给他提供避难所 换取他知道的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give him sanctuary in return for everything he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.22,0:57:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定让你去赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting you in the game…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.15,0:57:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,替换罪犯辛迪加组织的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…replacing someone who's playing for a syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.02,0:57:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听薇丽说你是队伍中最厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Villiers, you're the best player in the Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.99,0:57:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也不希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I wish it wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.47,0:57:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你是否能不动感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would ask you if you could remain emotionally detached…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.01,0:57:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看起来这对你来说不是问题 是吧 邦德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I don't think that's your problem, is it, Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.94,0:57:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.78,0:57:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心联系总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about keeping in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.65,0:57:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.15,0:57:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stop pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.49,0:57:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不会把它丢掉的 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew I wouldn't let this drop, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.59,0:57:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道你就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I knew you were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.40,0:57:58.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑山）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.30,0:58:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.35,0:58:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.02,0:58:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every penny of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.73,0:58:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,财政部决定资助你参加赌局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Treasury has agreed to stake you in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.20,0:58:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「黄昏」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Vesper."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.06,0:58:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是希望 你把钱给你父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do hope you gave your parents hell for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.33,0:58:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.04,0:58:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上司一定人脉深厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boss must be well-connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.84,0:58:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过这么多钱 轻而易举就批了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen so much go out the door so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.87,0:58:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未批得如此有型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or quite so stylishly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.61,0:58:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那钱在哪呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask you where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.25,0:58:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万已经电汇到你在黑山的账户里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten million was wired to your account in Montenegro…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.02,0:58:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有5百万的后备金 如果我认为投资值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a contingency for 5 more if I deem it a prudent investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.52,0:58:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你一定也想到过如果你输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you've given some thought to the notion that if you lose…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.76,0:58:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府就是在直接给恐怖组织提供资金\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our government will have directly financed terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.03,0:59:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好吃的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What looks good?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.67,0:59:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你说这是概率与赔率\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're telling me it's a matter of probability and odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.68,0:59:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还担心运气的问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was worried there was some chance involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.84,0:59:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候见过牌最好的人赢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, only if you assume the player with the best hand wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.05,0:59:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那就是你们所说的「诈牌」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that would be what you call "bluffing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.02,0:59:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你听说过这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard the term.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.02,0:59:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该知道你玩的并不是牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll also know that in poker you never play your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.72,0:59:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是玩你桌对面的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play the man across from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.29,0:59:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而你很会看透人 - 是的 我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you're good at reading people? - Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.86,0:59:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我能从你的言语中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I've been able to detect…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.76,0:59:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听出暗藏的讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an undercurrent of sarcasm in your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.60,0:59:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱在你手里我可不放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm now assured our money is in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.54,0:59:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这个计划并不看好 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think this is a very good plan, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.94,0:59:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 原来你还有个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there is a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.64,0:59:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你把百万金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the impression we were risking millions of dollars…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.41,0:59:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,成百人命 在赌桌上孤注一掷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and hundreds of lives on a game of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.85,0:59:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么高见呢？邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can you surmise, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.08,0:59:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,针对你的吗 林德小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About you, Miss Lynd?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.45,0:59:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的美貌是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your beauty's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.52,0:59:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕他人对你不重视\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worry you won't be taken seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.72,0:59:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都认为：美女无脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one can say of any attractive woman with half a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.92,1:00:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但你特意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, but this one overcompensates…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.72,1:00:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…着装男性化…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by wearing slightly masculine clothing…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.73,1:00:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,比其他女同事更咄咄逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…being more aggressive than her female colleagues…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.30,1:00:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人难以接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which gives her a somewhat prickly demeanor…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.97,1:00:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好笑的是 这同时也意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and ironically enough, makes it less likely for her to be accepted…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.50,1:00:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她难以被男上司赏识及提拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and promoted by her male superiors…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.91,1:00:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她的危机感误认为傲慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who mistake her insecurities for arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.18,1:00:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般会猜你是独生女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'd have normally gone with only child…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.41,1:00:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你对讽刺你父母的话毫无反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but, you see, by the way you ignored the quip about your parents…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.72,1:00:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你只能是个孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm gonna have to go with orphan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.36,1:00:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.16,1:00:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你衣着 你去了牛津之类的学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the cut of your suit, you went to Oxford or wherever…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.93,1:00:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还认为是人就应该这么穿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and actually think human beings dress like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.50,1:00:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你如此蔑视衣着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you wear it with such disdain…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.60,1:00:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你家中并没钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my guess is you didn't come from money…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.70,1:00:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同学从未让你忘记这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and your school friends never let you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.47,1:00:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此说来 你上学的钱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you were at that school by the grace…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.77,1:00:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…必是受他人恩惠\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of someone else's charity, hence the chip on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.68,1:00:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你非常忌讳 你先猜我是个孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since your first thought about me ran to orphan…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.38,1:00:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰恰说明你才是孤儿出身\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that's what I'd say you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.32,1:01:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.79,1:01:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this poker thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.82,1:01:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也合情合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that makes perfect sense…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.79,1:01:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当英国军情6处看中你 这样不经事的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…since Ml6 looks for maladjusted young men…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.39,1:01:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以无视他人性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that give little thought to sacrificing others…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.86,1:01:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护祖国和女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in order to protect Queen and country.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.27,1:01:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.57,1:01:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,前特别空勤团成员 笑容满面 腕带名表\N{\fnArial\fs30}…former SAS types with easy smiles and expensive watches.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.00,1:01:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劳力士？- 欧米加\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rolex? - Omega.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.57,1:01:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.91,1:01:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, having just met you…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.84,1:01:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不会就冒然说你是 一个冷酷的杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I wouldn't go as far as calling you a cold-hearted bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.81,1:01:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.08,1:01:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也不难想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wouldn't be a stretch to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.28,1:01:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你视女人为可抛弃的玩物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think of women as disposable pleasures…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.65,1:01:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而非实际追求的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rather than meaningful pursuits.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.22,1:01:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你风度翩翩 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So as charming as you are, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.56,1:01:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会牢牢看好我国政府的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I will be keeping my eye on our government's money…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.23,1:01:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不会去注意你丰满的臀部\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and off your perfectly formed arse.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.66,1:01:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You noticed?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.37,1:01:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算会计也是有想象力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even accountants have imagination.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.60,1:01:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的羊肉味道如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your lamb?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.37,1:01:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skewered.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.07,1:01:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人心痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sympathizes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.54,1:01:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.24,1:02:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 林德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Miss Lynd.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.09,1:02:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去华美饭店吗？先生 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hotel Splendid, sir? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.43,1:02:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.08,1:02:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是些最后的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just last-minute details.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.59,1:02:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来 我们深深相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently we're very much in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.06,1:02:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你平时都是让服务生 来告诉你这些事情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you usually leave it to porters to tell you this sort of thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.23,1:02:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有当爱情必须短暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only when the romance has been necessarily brief.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.33,1:02:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是达林顿·比奇 专业赌徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mr. Arlington Beech, professional gambler…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.50,1:02:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是斯黛夫尼·波切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you're Miss Stephanie Broadchest.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.27,1:02:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不当 - 这方面你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am not. - You're gonna have to trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.67,1:03:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.94,1:03:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相爱已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been involved for quite a while…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.56,1:03:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次共用一间套房\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hence the shared suite.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.53,1:03:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家里人都是严格的罗马天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my family is strict Roman Catholic…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.10,1:03:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为掩人耳目 我们该要间双卧室套房\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so for appearances' sake, it'll be a two-bedroom suite.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.03,1:03:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在讨厌宗教给我们制造隔阂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hate it when religion comes between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.60,1:03:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗教还有紧锁的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Religion and a securely locked door.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.24,1:03:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对此不会有意见吧 邦德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I going to have a problem with you, Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.37,1:03:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 不用担心 你根本不合我的口味\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't worry. You're not my type.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.38,1:03:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是太聪明了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.08,1:03:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是单身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Single.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.00,1:03:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临华美饭店 您贵姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Hotel Splendid. Your name, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.20,1:03:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·邦德 是用比奇的名字预定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond. You'll find the reservation under Beech.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.27,1:03:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎您 邦德先生 - 你来签字 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome, Mr. Bond. - You sign that, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.64,1:03:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你代表财政部嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You represent the Treasury.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.32,1:04:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 祝您住得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.18,1:04:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.79,1:04:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.16,1:04:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果拉西福真的消息灵通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if Le Chiffre is that well-connected…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.33,1:04:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然知道我是什么人 也知道钱的来路\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he knows who I am and where the money's from.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.66,1:04:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他仍坚持和我赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means he's decided to play me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.03,1:04:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是他走投无路 要么是他狂妄自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's either desperate or he's overly confident…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.60,1:04:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论原因何在 都有助于我了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but either way, that tells me something about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.10,1:04:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他所得到的不过是 个早已知道的名字而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all he gets in return is a name he already has.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.94,1:04:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他倒是对你有些了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he knows something about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.78,1:04:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做事不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows you're reckless.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.68,1:04:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下一部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the next one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.68,1:04:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里装不下我和你的自我膨胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't enough room for me and your ego.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.95,1:04:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.65,1:04:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是您的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was left for you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.12,1:05:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 M\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too, M.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.86,1:05:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫马西斯 林尼·马西斯 是你们这里的接头人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Mathis. Rene Mathis. I'm your contact here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.60,1:06:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们在监视他么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he know we've been watching him?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.30,1:06:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福？不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le Chiffre? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.17,1:06:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只有「我」 而不是「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably because there's no "we." Just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.14,1:06:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 如果你们惹祸上身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid if you get into trouble here…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.31,1:06:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近可没有救兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the cavalry won't be coming over the nearest hill.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.68,1:06:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福昨天刚到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le Chiffre arrived yesterday…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.92,1:06:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在重建关系网\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and spent the time reestablishing old relationships.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.06,1:06:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察局长和他现在走的很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief of police and he are now quite close.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.19,1:06:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个小胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him, with the mustache.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.30,1:06:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我左肩这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over my left shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.93,1:06:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此说来很棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that could make life quite difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.33,1:06:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但不会很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and quite possibly shorter.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.50,1:06:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个贪财的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a very subtle man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.34,1:06:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也试图收买他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about trying to buy his services, but we frankly…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.71,1:06:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但出价不如拉西福高\N{\fnArial\fs30}…couldn't afford to outbid Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.02,1:06:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to say it…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.39,1:06:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今是些会计在管理英国军情6处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the accountants seem to be running Ml6 these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.43,1:07:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对会计并无偏见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not that I have anything against accountants.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.83,1:07:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多会计都很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of them are lovely people.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.63,1:07:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我决定省一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I decided that it was cheaper to supply his deputy…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他收受贿赂的证据交给副局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with evidence that we were bribing the chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.74,1:07:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的图像软件真是无所不能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing what you can do with Photoshop these days, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.02,1:07:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的进步也不小啊 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your odds are improving, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.12,1:07:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.16,1:07:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.00,1:07:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望我穿这个么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you expect me to wear?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.97,1:07:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得打扮得光彩照人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you looking fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.50,1:07:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你走到我身后 轻吻我的脖子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when you walk up behind me and kiss me on the neck…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.00,1:07:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对手们只会注意你纤细柔美的颈部曲线\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the players will be thinking about your neckline…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.57,1:07:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是他们手中的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and not about their cards.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.51,1:07:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我这个忙么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you can do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.11,1:07:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.11,1:07:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.06,1:08:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经有晚礼服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a dinner jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.50,1:08:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有平常的晚礼服 和特别的晚礼服之分\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are dinner jackets and dinner jackets.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.03,1:08:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件是后者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the latter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.40,1:08:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得看起来像够格上桌的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need you looking like a man who belongs at that table.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.04,1:08:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.47,1:08:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是手工缝制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tailored.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.14,1:08:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一见面时就知道你的尺寸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sized you up the moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.30,1:09:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 先生 - 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, sir. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.66,1:09:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.31,1:09:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是代替布利斯特先生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must be Mr. Bliss' replacement.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.65,1:09:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 比奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Mr. Beech.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.95,1:09:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是邦德呢？我有点糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is that Bond? I'm a little confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.96,1:09:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不希望那样 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we wouldn't want that, would we?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.92,1:09:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孟德尔先生 这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Mendel, way please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.90,1:09:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 欢迎您们的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.04,1:09:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你们所知 我们将要玩的是德州扑克\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, the game is no-limit hold 'em poker.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.84,1:10:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人2张底牌 5张公共牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five communal cards, two in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.24,1:10:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,孟德尔先生代表瑞士巴塞尔银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Mendel here represents the Basel Bank, Switzerland…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.25,1:10:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,保管赌金\N{\fnArial\fs30}…holding the stakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.51,1:10:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have each deposited $10 million buy-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.78,1:10:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们每人已存入1千万赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}A further buy-in of 5 million can be made by electronic transfer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.49,1:10:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可再电汇赌注5百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money will remain in escrow until I return…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.59,1:10:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注会由本行保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the winner of the contest enters his or her password…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.89,1:10:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到赌局赢家 在加密机内输入密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into the encryptor…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.19,1:10:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时全部赌金将会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whereupon the entire sum will be wired…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.13,1:10:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,电汇到您指定的世界上任何一个账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to any bank account in the world you nominate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.83,1:10:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.00,1:10:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按字母顺序来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We proceed alphabetically.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.37,1:10:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您上前输入您的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be so kind as to enter a password of your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.21,1:10:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少6个字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six letters or more.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.46,1:10:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,由套牌来决定发牌顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}High card for dealer position.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.24,1:11:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,加亚多先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Signor Gallardo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.74,1:11:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘米尔斯基先生下小盲注 5千美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kaminofsky is the small blind, $5000…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.91,1:11:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,福津先生下大盲注 1万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Mr. Fukutu, the big blind, $10, 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.48,1:11:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位请尽兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, enjoy the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.37,1:11:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有4位玩家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four players.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.08,1:11:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该您下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.95,1:11:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.62,1:11:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.72,1:11:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注 50万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. Fifty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.00,1:12:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.54,1:12:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.01,1:12:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌 单挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold. Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.72,1:12:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.66,1:12:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注10万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. One hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.44,1:12:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要在众人瞩目时登场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't you supposed to enter so the others could see you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.54,1:12:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是么？抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was l? Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.11,1:12:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.12,1:12:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该您了 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you, Monsieur Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.49,1:13:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.89,1:13:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 赌注是多少？10万？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. What was the bet? A hundred thousand?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.36,1:13:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.23,1:13:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.60,1:13:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去真是太美丽动人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I don't have to tell you how beautiful you look.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.41,1:13:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌桌上一半的人都还盯着你看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half the people at that table are still watching you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.74,1:13:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.41,1:13:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.39,1:13:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注20万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. Two hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.07,1:13:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 有人跟进了 请亮牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur, you have been called. Showdown, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.50,1:13:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福先生 满堂红 三个2 两个9\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full house to Monsieur Le Chiffre. Deuces full of nines.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.87,1:13:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.58,1:13:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.29,1:14:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请叫一下吧台服务生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the barman over, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.77,1:14:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一杯干马提尼 - 好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A dry martini. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.77,1:14:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 3份哥顿琴酒 1份伏特加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three measures Gordon's, one of vodka…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.67,1:14:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,半份莉兰开胃酒加冰摇匀\N{\fnArial\fs30}…half of Kina Lillet, shake it over ice…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.71,1:14:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加条薄柠檬皮调味 - 好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …then add a thin slice of lemon peel. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.74,1:14:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 给我也来一杯 - 那我也要一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, I'll have one of those. - So will l.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.58,1:14:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.75,1:14:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 也给我来一杯吧 柠檬就省了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, bring me one as well. Keep the fruit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.62,1:14:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,完事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.16,1:14:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大家都可以静下来打牌了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone want to play poker now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.96,1:14:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人很心急啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.13,1:14:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.58,1:15:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很可口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taste nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.12,1:15:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不是已经不要伪装了吗？- 错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought we dispensed with covers. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.25,1:15:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的伪装当然丢掉 我们现在创造有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dispensed with one that was of no use and created another that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.26,1:15:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在看么？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he watching? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.99,1:15:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.16,1:15:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扮演的角色很生气 因为你输得这么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me in character pissed off because you're losing so fast…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.13,1:15:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕难过午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we won't be here past midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.10,1:15:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的是我和我的角色有同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oddly, my character's feelings mirror my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.70,1:15:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.91,1:15:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 味道还真是不错 - 该您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, that's not half bad. - Up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.94,1:15:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得给它想个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to think up a name for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.38,1:15:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,花点钱探出他的马脚绝对值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth it to discover his tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.41,1:15:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.98,1:15:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他诈牌时左眼轻微抽搐 他会用手遮挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The twitch he has to hide when he bluffs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.15,1:15:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诈牌？他手里的牌是最大 - 他最后才拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bluffs? He had the best hand. - Which he got on the last card.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.49,1:15:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,几率是23比1 他当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The odds against were 23-to-1, and he'd know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.89,1:15:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他第一次加注时 什么牌都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he did his first raise he had nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.16,1:15:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过运气罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winning was blind luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.80,1:15:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带了监听器吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get the bug? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.83,1:15:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,下注10万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. One hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.90,1:15:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.24,1:16:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到您了 福津先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your play, Monsieur Fukutu.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.87,1:16:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他真的能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he can actually pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.74,1:16:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.78,1:16:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.28,1:16:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, Mesdames, Messieurs…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.02,1:16:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌局已经进行了4个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we've now been playing for four hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.99,1:16:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在休息片刻 一个小时后继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for a short break. We will resume play in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.29,1:16:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会报告今晚的进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think I'll report on the evening's frivolities.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.66,1:17:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.76,1:17:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他监视我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to do what to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.07,1:17:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不懂你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost me completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.60,1:17:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是刚说迫不及待要和我回房么 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just said you can't wait to get me back to the room. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.56,1:17:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底什么事这么重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's so damn important?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.57,1:17:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.04,1:17:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my money?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.14,1:17:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 - 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.58,1:17:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿我的包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're holding a parcel for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.42,1:17:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.39,1:18:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为损失了那么多钱 没有人会发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you can lose that kind of money and no one would notice?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.06,1:18:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的钱我会还的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your money is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.66,1:18:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.41,1:18:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天就能还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.42,1:18:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,分文不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.30,1:18:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗我的代价是一只手 不过你还需要它来玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would take a hand for this betrayal, but you need it to play cards.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.71,1:18:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸开手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold out your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.71,1:18:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸开手臂 美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold out your arm, my beauty…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.15,1:18:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就砍你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or I will take your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.66,1:19:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回房 在那里等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the room. Wait for me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.97,1:19:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.48,1:19:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然连句抗议都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word of protest.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.65,1:19:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该换男朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should find a new boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.37,1:21:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找马西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find Mathis.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.34,1:21:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我把尸体藏在这里 让他把尸体处理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I've hidden the bodies here and I want him to get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.71,1:21:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 快啊 快去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that now. Go. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.58,1:22:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换了件衬衫 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed your shirt, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.52,1:22:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种小游戏不会让你出大汗淋漓吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope our little game isn't causing you to perspire.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.42,1:22:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.85,1:23:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我开始流血泪 不然不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I won't consider myself to be in trouble until I start weeping blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.62,1:23:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 如果大家都准备好了 就继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, if everybody's ready, let's continue the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.89,1:24:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我手染鲜血 怎么洗都洗不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like there's blood on my hands. It's not coming off.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.29,1:24:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.75,1:24:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好点了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.65,1:24:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.19,1:24:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.79,1:24:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.41,1:25:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体有问题么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any trouble with the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.05,1:25:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than some.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.96,1:26:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人一样有用途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being dead doesn't mean one can't still be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.64,1:26:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福以后会诚惶诚恐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll keep Le Chiffre looking over his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.54,1:26:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心还有谁在背地里算计他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be wondering who's gonna come for him next.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.41,1:26:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's our girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.25,1:26:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你冰冷的心融化了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melted your cold heart yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.40,1:26:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.70,1:26:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.40,1:26:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.57,1:26:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有3位玩家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three players.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.24,1:26:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,30万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred grand.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.21,1:26:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注30万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. Three hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.82,1:26:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.15,1:26:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.29,1:27:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有3位玩家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three players.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.93,1:27:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.51,1:27:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.48,1:27:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注50万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. Five hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.60,1:27:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 他露出了马脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. It's the tell. He is bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.10,1:27:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊 詹姆斯说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, James was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.24,1:27:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.31,1:27:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,加注 1百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise. One million.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.79,1:28:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人知道其中奥妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems someone knows something I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.19,1:28:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.59,1:28:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,单挑 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.56,1:28:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.38,1:28:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,2百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.55,1:28:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加注 2百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re-raise. Two million.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.62,1:28:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.80,1:28:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.04,1:28:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,4千零50万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's 14 million and 500, 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.61,1:28:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该您了 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you, Monsieur Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.65,1:29:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德必须全押 才能破他的诈牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond will have to go all in to call his bluff.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.92,1:29:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟进 - 跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call. - Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.06,1:29:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 请摊牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, showdown, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.16,1:29:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,满堂红 3个K和2个A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full house. Kings and aces.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.76,1:29:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉西福先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.75,1:29:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,4个J 拉西福先生胜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's four jacks. Monsieur Le Chiffre wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.45,1:29:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我在诈牌 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have thought I was bluffing, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.29,1:29:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.66,1:29:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在休息一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will now break for one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.16,1:29:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们继续时 大盲注增加为20万\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we return, the big blind will be 200, 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.94,1:29:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good game.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.73,1:30:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要5百万重新入局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna need the other 5 million to buy back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.64,1:30:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能给你 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.51,1:30:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我犯了错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.71,1:30:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许因为没耐心 也许是太轻敌 但我一定能打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was impatient, maybe I was arrogant, but I can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.91,1:30:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 抱歉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.42,1:30:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.05,1:30:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try putting that in a sentence.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.02,1:30:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,“抱歉 拉西福赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry Le Chiffre's gonna win…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.62,1:30:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续给恐怖分子提供经费 屠杀无辜百姓” 那种“抱歉”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}continue funding terror and killing." That kind of sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.16,1:30:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输光是因为你太自负 要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost because of your ego, and that same ego can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.16,1:30:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过想挽回面子罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.03,1:30:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样下去 你只能输更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you're going to do now is lose more.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.63,1:30:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.00,1:31:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 我说你愚蠢透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry? - I said, you're a bloody idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.84,1:31:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.84,1:31:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能打败他 你是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can beat this man, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.21,1:31:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hand off my arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.74,1:31:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏特加混马提尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vodka martini.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.07,1:31:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摇匀还是搅拌的？- 你看我他妈的在乎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shaken or stirred? - Do I look like I give a damn?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.06,1:32:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 - 带那姑娘走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James. - Get the girl out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.60,1:32:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是场离奇的赌局 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny game, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.77,1:32:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是兄弟 早就应该自我介绍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I should've introduced myself, seeing as we're related.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.61,1:32:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力克斯·莱特 美国中情局的弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix Leiter, a brother from Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.75,1:32:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要有点信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have a little faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.41,1:32:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你要头脑清醒才能打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you keep your head about you, I think you have him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.02,1:32:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经能 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.75,1:32:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再买赌注了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not buying in?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.42,1:32:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.06,1:32:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我输地很快 恐怕坚持不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm bleeding chips. I'm not gonna last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.20,1:32:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢的机会比我大 我来资助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a better chance. I'll stake you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.94,1:32:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我给你钱让你能继续赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying I'll give you the money to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.24,1:32:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有个条件 如果你赢了 要由美国中情局逮捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one thing. If you pull it off, the ClA bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.54,1:32:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那赢的钱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the winnings?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.55,1:32:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们缺钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it look like we need the money?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.66,1:33:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要盲注么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we up the blinds?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.93,1:33:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.10,1:33:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.67,1:33:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,加注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.86,1:33:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fold.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.03,1:33:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.70,1:33:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.80,1:33:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.24,1:33:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加注50万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise. Five hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.21,1:33:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收牌 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fold. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.58,1:34:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.95,1:34:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,收牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.39,1:34:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.03,1:34:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.12,1:34:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.28,1:34:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生 您要下大盲注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir. You are the big blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.39,1:34:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下小盲注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small blind, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.06,1:35:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？- 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is it? - It's 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.13,1:35:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德被下毒了 马上就要心脏停跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond's been poisoned. He's going into cardiac arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.86,1:36:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静 不要打断我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm and don't interrupt. Because you'll be dead…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.50,1:36:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不照我说的做 你两分钟内就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…within two minutes unless you do exactly what I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.44,1:36:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,全听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.80,1:36:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从箱中拿出除颤器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove the defibrillator from the pouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.54,1:36:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道是什么毒吗？- 还在扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we know what it is yet? - We're still scanning.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.51,1:36:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,将探头贴到你胸口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attach the leads to your chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.89,1:36:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,室性心动过速 是毛地黄制剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ventricular tachycardia. Digitalis.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.16,1:36:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能提供什么该给他？工具箱里有安非他明 抗组胺药\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we give him? The kit has amphetamines, antihistamines…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.16,1:36:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,氢化可的松 还是肾上腺素？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hydrocortisone. Adrenalin?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.00,1:36:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等它充电完成… - 可以用利多卡因\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As soon as it reads charged… - Lidocaine. That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.94,1:36:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 先不要按红钮 听到了吗？不要按红钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond, don't push the red button yet. Do you hear me? Don't push it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.60,1:36:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心脏要停跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart's gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.24,1:36:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只够时间做一次电击\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only time for one charge before he passes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.61,1:36:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 用蓝色多用笔 脖子中间 轧入血管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the blue combipen, Bond. Mid-neck into the vein.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.68,1:36:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有助于解毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll counteract the digitalis.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.29,1:36:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几秒内就会昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to pass out in a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.29,1:36:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让心脏继续跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to keep your heart going.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.92,1:36:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 现在按红钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push the red button now, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.26,1:37:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德 按那该死的钮！- 快动手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bond, push the damn button! - Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.58,1:37:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.89,1:38:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.69,1:38:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在去医院 - 会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now get yourself off to a hospital. - I will do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.36,1:38:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,得等我赢了先\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I've won this game.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.03,1:38:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真的要回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not seriously going back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.27,1:38:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做梦都想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't dream of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.80,1:38:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注一百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. One million.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.14,1:38:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全押 - 跟进 全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All in. - Call. All in.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.91,1:38:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 请摊牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, showdown, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.52,1:38:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,两对 A和7\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two pair. Aces and sevens.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.35,1:38:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,比单张 Q胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen plays. Wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.37,1:38:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.77,1:38:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那手差点搞死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That last hand, it nearly killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.84,1:38:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 换完筹码就进入最后阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, with this chip exchange, we enter the final phase of the game…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.58,1:38:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着不能加买筹码了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which means no more buy-ins.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.54,1:39:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大盲注是一百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big blind is now 1 million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.82,1:39:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有四位玩家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four players.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.76,1:39:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.16,1:39:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生 - 让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Monsieur Bond? - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.53,1:39:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让牌 - 台面上有2千4百万了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - Twenty-four million in the pot already.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.24,1:39:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让牌 让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check. And check.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.81,1:39:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}All check.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.74,1:39:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有四位玩家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four players.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.95,1:39:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让牌 - 让牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.26,1:39:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,全押 6百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in. Six million.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.33,1:39:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注6百万 全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet. Six million. All in.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.30,1:39:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,5百万全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five million. All in.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.84,1:39:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,押注是6百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet is 6 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.91,1:40:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,加注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.82,1:40:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,加注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.22,1:40:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,1千2百万 单挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve million. Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.08,1:40:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,4050万全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty million, 500, 000. All in.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.66,1:40:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,加注 全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise. All in.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.38,1:41:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我想我要跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think I will call you on that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.82,1:41:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.90,1:41:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,桌面上是1亿5千万\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred and fifteen million in the pot.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.31,1:41:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 请摊牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, showdown, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.68,1:41:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,同花 AKQ\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flush. Ace, king, queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.19,1:41:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,满堂红 对A和三个8\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full house. Eights full of aces.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.34,1:42:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,更强的满堂红\N{\fnArial\fs30}A higher full house.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.68,1:42:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对6和三个A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aces full of sixes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.15,1:42:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.40,1:42:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑桃5 7\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five and seven of spades.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.11,1:42:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,同花顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}A straight flush.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.78,1:42:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,从4到8\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four to the eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.28,1:42:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The high hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.08,1:42:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Bond wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.62,1:43:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你的 - 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For you. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.36,1:43:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.76,1:43:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 归你了 - 感激不尽 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's all yours. - Much appreciated, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.27,1:43:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.64,1:43:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆功会应该准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think a celebration's in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.71,1:43:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时前你差点死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were almost dead an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.11,1:43:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我饿坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'm famished.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.52,1:43:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.00,1:43:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,马西斯说美国人与拉西福接触了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mathis says the Americans have made contact with Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.10,1:43:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们天亮前带走他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to extract him before dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.44,1:43:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我打算叫它「维斯帕」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think I'll call that a Vesper.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.81,1:43:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它有点苦的回味？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the bitter aftertaste?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.81,1:44:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 因为你只要尝过 以后就只想喝它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Because once you've tasted it, that's all you want to drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.59,1:44:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这台词不错 - 是很好的台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought that was quite a good line. - lt was a very good line.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.92,1:44:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're laughing at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.76,1:44:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没你笑得厉害 - 哦 那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not so much it as you. - Well, that's fine then.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.34,1:44:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out what that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.34,1:44:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个阿尔及利亚的相思结\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an Algerian love knot.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.81,1:44:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？我只是觉得它漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I thought it was just something pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.21,1:44:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.75,1:44:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人送给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone gave that to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.92,1:44:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very lucky man.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.16,1:44:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你转换状态很容易 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can switch off so easily, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.36,1:44:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了那些人你也不放在心上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't bother you, killing those people?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.17,1:44:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果在意就没法尽心尽责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wouldn't be very good at my job if it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.14,1:45:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.01,1:45:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以选择 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a choice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.38,1:45:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为任务完成后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you've done something…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.18,1:45:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不意味着要继续接任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}…doesn't mean you have to keep doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.51,1:45:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么人总是要提出意见 而不是接受意见呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it people who can't take advice always insist on giving it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.62,1:45:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我不能接受意见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I can't take my own advice?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.49,1:45:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为有什么东西在驱使你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think something is driving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.69,1:45:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我永远都不会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I'll never find out what that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.66,1:45:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,马西斯要见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mathis needs me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.47,1:45:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.94,1:45:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations again.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.56,1:45:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,马西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mathis.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.34,1:47:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕你的朋友马西斯 其实是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid your friend Mathis is really…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.54,1:47:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my friend Mathis.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.11,1:49:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很爱惜你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've taken good care of your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.39,1:49:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是浪费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.14,1:50:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.34,1:50:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没搞明白那些复杂的折磨工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I never understood all these elaborate tortures.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.68,1:50:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄出男人难以忍受的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the simplest thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.08,1:50:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是一件非常容易的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to cause more pain than a man can possibly endure.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.12,1:50:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.49,1:50:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不光是马上感觉到的巨大痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's not only the immediate agony, but the knowledge…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.66,1:50:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你如果不快点招供的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that if you do not yield soon enough…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.03,1:50:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有可能就不能再做为男人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there will be little left to identify you as a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.74,1:50:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only question remains…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.14,1:50:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否能及时招供\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will you yield in time?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.38,1:50:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要那笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.24,1:51:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,林德小姐会给我账号 就算她现在还没给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Lynd will give me the account number, if she hasn't already.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.87,1:51:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我只需要你给我密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all I need from you is the password.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.02,1:51:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The password, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.49,1:51:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那里有一点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a little itch…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.99,1:51:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,痒痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}…down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.63,1:51:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.84,1:51:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.21,1:51:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 右边一点 往右\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. To the right. To the right. To the right!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.11,1:51:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很搞笑 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a funny man, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.49,1:51:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.22,1:51:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.20,1:52:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在全世界都知道 你死于给我蛋蛋挠痒痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the whole world's gonna know that you died scratching my balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.94,1:52:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I died?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.14,1:52:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我死了？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I died? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.64,1:52:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不管怎样 我都不会给你密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because no matter what you do, I'm not gonna give you the password.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.81,1:52:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你的客户会追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means your clients will hunt you down…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.85,1:52:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你活生生的撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and cut you into pieces of meat while you're still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.88,1:52:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you kill me…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.48,1:52:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就无处可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there'll be nowhere else to hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.75,1:52:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你错大了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are so wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.76,1:52:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我宰了你和你的小女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because even after I slaughtered you and your little girlfriend…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.96,1:52:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人仍然会张开臂膀欢迎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your people would still welcome me with open arms…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.30,1:52:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们需要我所知道的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because they need what I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.17,1:52:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,全局情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.15,1:52:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把密码给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the password…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.58,1:52:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我至少会让她活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I will at least let her live.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.19,1:53:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 你快点的话 她可能还是完整的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond. Do it soon enough and she might even be in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.37,1:53:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不会告诉我 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really aren't going to tell me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.71,1:53:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.34,1:53:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.78,1:53:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你不在乎的东西喂给你吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'll feed you what you seem not to value.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.37,1:53:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拿到钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.60,1:53:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我会拿到钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them I'll get the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.24,1:53:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对组织来说 知道谁可信比钱更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money isn't as valuable to our organization as knowing who to trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.28,1:54:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰西斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.62,1:54:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰西斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.23,1:54:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vesper.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.29,1:54:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vesper.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.32,1:54:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.76,1:54:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.26,1:54:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是马西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Mathis.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.00,1:54:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.03,1:54:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找医生来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.74,1:55:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.54,1:55:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.35,1:55:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他们为何放你们生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Why they left the two of you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.19,1:55:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.66,1:55:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.16,1:55:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该要让你喝这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm supposed to get you to drink this.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.53,1:55:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是奇怪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just odd…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.40,1:55:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它人都杀了 只留下你和她活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…killing everyone else but leaving you and her untouched.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.50,1:55:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要告诉我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost as if someone was trying to tell us something.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.01,1:55:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到杀手了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a look at the killer?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.68,1:55:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.88,1:55:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.98,1:55:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.12,1:55:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else you remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.49,1:55:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可以帮助我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that can help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.73,1:55:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.56,1:55:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是帮助你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.17,1:56:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.54,1:56:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.07,1:56:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.01,1:56:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍不住要叫醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't resist waking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.38,1:56:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次叫醒你 你看着我 就像多年未见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I do, you look at me as if you haven't seen me in years.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.15,1:56:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得重获新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me feel reborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.89,1:57:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你刚生下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd just been born…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.66,1:57:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是应该赤裸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wouldn't you be naked?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.70,1:57:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以拥有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.57,1:57:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随时可以拥有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have me anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.34,1:57:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.08,1:57:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这里 那里 任何你喜欢的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Here, there, anywhere you like.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.95,1:57:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是否意味说你对我有感觉了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean that you're warming to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.05,1:57:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's how I would describe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.45,1:57:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that not so long ago…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.09,1:57:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的态度让我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I would have described your feelings towards me as…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.43,1:57:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到比「厌恶」更好的词了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to think of a better word than "loathing."
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.63,1:57:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕是个复杂的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'm a complicated woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.07,1:57:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你害怕某些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is something to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.34,1:57:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 哦 真不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Oh, perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.41,1:57:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,孟德尔先生 瑞士情形如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Mendel. How are things in Switzerland?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.35,1:57:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我不想打搅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies, I do not mean to rush…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.55,1:57:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过1亿2千万是很大一笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but 120 million is a large sum of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.75,1:58:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是 你确定没有带巧克力来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It certainly is. You didn't bring any chocolates with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.79,1:58:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.12,1:58:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请输入账号\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would type in the account number.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.07,1:58:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now the password.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.27,1:58:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.14,1:58:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我知道的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would if I knew what it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.81,1:58:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}V-E-S-P-E-R.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.09,1:58:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,资金已转帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The funds have been transferred.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.03,1:58:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打搅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for disturbing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.73,1:58:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见 孟德尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Auf Wiedersehen. - Auf Wiedersehen, Herr Mendel.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.54,1:58:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, James…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.54,1:59:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你只剩下你的微笑和手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I just want you to know that if all that was left of you…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.65,1:59:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然是我所见过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was your smile and your little finger…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.15,1:59:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最像男人的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'd still be more of a man than anyone I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.30,1:59:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你知道 我用手指能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because you know what I can do with my little finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.94,1:59:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 但你急着想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have no idea. - But you're aching to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.98,1:59:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会接受我的 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to let me in there, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.71,1:59:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经又回到你的铠甲里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got your armor back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.98,1:59:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's that.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.72,1:59:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有铠甲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no armor left.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.52,1:59:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经被你剥去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've stripped it from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.89,1:59:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever is left of me…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.83,1:59:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我剩下什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever is left of me…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.53,1:59:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whatever I am…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.70,1:59:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.63,2:01:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,M几天内不会找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose M won't miss me for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.37,2:01:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会忙于拷问马西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be too busy sweating Mathis.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.41,2:01:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马西斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mathis?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.81,2:01:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你拉西福的马脚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember I told you about Le Chiffre's tell?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.04,2:01:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,马西斯告诉了拉西福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mathis told Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.05,2:01:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他能赢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he wiped me out.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.81,2:01:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有追踪器 他们不会轻易知道它的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same goes for the implant. Can't say I'm too sorry about losing that.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.91,2:01:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if that's why I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.98,2:01:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love me?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.45,2:01:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱到辞职跟你去环游世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to quit and float round the world with you…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.92,2:01:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们之一找到正当的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until one of us has to find an honest job.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.80,2:02:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那只能是你去找了 因为我不知道什么是正当的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think that's gonna have to be you. I've no idea what an honest job is.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.77,2:02:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.13,2:02:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.60,2:02:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这种事太久的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you do what I do for too long…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.60,2:02:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不会剩下什么良心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and there won't be any soul left to salvage.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.61,2:02:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带着我仅剩的一点离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving with what little I have left.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.38,2:02:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道给你够不够？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.82,2:04:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.22,2:04:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 停下 不 我要去银行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop it. Stop. I have to get to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.62,2:04:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the time?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.06,2:04:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们航海一个月要多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do we need to float for a month?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.60,2:04:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got plenty.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.57,2:04:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要支付我的那一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I want to pay for my half of our aimless wanderings.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.44,2:04:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再戴上那条项链了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stopped wearing the necklace.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.97,2:04:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 到时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was time.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.34,2:04:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间让你从对某人的记忆中恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time enough to get over someone?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.85,2:04:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你意识到有时过去是能遗忘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To realize sometimes you can forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.93,2:04:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是老板是不能忘记的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though apparently not your employer.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.27,2:05:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月内回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in one month.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.57,2:05:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我去取钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'll get the money…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.18,2:05:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去买给养\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you get supplies.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.11,2:05:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,半小时后在这里会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you back here in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.94,2:06:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 M - 我收到你的消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, M. - I got your note.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.57,2:06:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.44,2:06:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about that later.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.48,2:06:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们这里有位财政部的可爱先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I have a lovely man from the Treasury here…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.71,2:06:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要知道你是否会把钱存回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wondering if you're ever going to deposit the winnings.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.95,2:06:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是遗憾 我不知道他们会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shame. I didn't think they'd miss it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.99,2:06:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我告诉他们不要担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Well, I told them not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.49,2:06:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天要把钱存进账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll be depositing it today.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.13,2:06:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在去银行的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way to the bank right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.06,2:06:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·邦德 我要同莫德尔先生说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond for Mr. Mendel.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.23,2:06:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.57,2:06:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫德尔先生？我好像无法拿到我账号里的资金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Mendel? I'm having trouble accessing the funds in my account.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.17,2:06:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 钱被转到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was transferred to the account number…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.21,2:06:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你公司指定的账号上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your company gave us, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.15,2:06:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像资金现在正被取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears the funds are being withdrawn as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.25,2:06:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？- 当然是威尼斯分行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - The Venice branch, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.29,2:06:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣马克广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Mark's Square.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.62,2:06:58.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（30分钟后见）
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.89,2:07:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.29,2:09:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill her!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.46,2:09:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.59,2:13:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.22,2:16:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有一个男朋友 有法国和阿尔及利亚血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a boyfriend. A French Algerian.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.15,2:16:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were very much in love.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.62,2:16:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被拉西福背后的组织绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was kidnapped by the organization behind Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.96,2:17:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们威胁她要合作 否则杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they blackmailed her, threatening to kill him unless she cooperated.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.13,2:17:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should've picked up on it…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.70,2:17:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们太专注于我们的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but sometimes we're so focused on our enemies…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.13,2:17:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而忘记监视我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we forget to watch our friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.30,2:17:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.54,2:17:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她留下了她的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left her cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.94,2:17:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定知道我要检查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must have known I'd check it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.14,2:17:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道你就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew you were you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.35,2:17:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少让马西斯脱罪 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, at least this clears Mathis. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.78,2:17:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.62,2:17:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是证明她有罪 不是他无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just proved that she's guilty, not that he's innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.32,2:17:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能都是内奸 继续拷问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've been a double blind. Keep sweating him.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.46,2:17:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谁也不信吗 詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust anyone, do you, James?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:34.42,2:17:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.56,2:17:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你学到教训了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you've learnt your lesson.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.63,2:17:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶快回来 我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back as soon as you can. We need you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.57,2:17:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.00,2:17:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果真需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do need time…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.57,2:17:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我需要时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I need more time?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.97,2:17:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作完成了 那婊子死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The job's done, and the bitch is dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.11,2:17:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}James…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:56.71,2:18:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有问过自己 为何当晚你没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…did you ever ask yourself why you weren't killed that night?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.62,2:18:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是很清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.52,2:18:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用钱换了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made a deal to spare your life in exchange for the money.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.69,2:18:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定她希望他们放过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she hoped they would let her live.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.43,2:18:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她肯定知道自己必死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she must have known she was going to her death.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.53,2:18:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们无从知道谁是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we'll never know who was behind this.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.67,2:18:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,线索断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trail's gone cold.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.34,2:18:58.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（给詹姆斯：怀特先生 +3926222431）
Dialogue: 0,2:19:47.76,2:19:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 怀特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Mr. White?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.86,2:19:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.56,2:19:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.73,2:20:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大名是邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.93,2:20:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
